## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical, beginner-friendly network isolation and policy enforcement in Azure, plus a rollback path that doesn't require outages.

## Key Concepts

- Private Endpoint
- Azure Policy / Initiatives
- DenyPublicNetworkAccess
- Managed Identities
- Canary and rollback strategy

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example policy snippet (JSON-like)
const policy = {
  mode: "All",
  policyRule: {
    if: { field: "type", equals: "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts" },
    then: { effect: "Deny" }
  }
};
```

